(text "32 named nets link the sheets through native global labels.\nPower: XIAO / USB / battery, boost and switched 5 V.\nAcquisition: TE bridge, ratiometric ADS1220 and SPI.\nControls: 5 V end-switch contact and wake/tare button." (at 25 128 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left)) (uuid "8bc3cc41-72fd-570e-a013-67391d9b6fd1"))
(text "PCB target: 19.5 x 68.5 x 0.8 mm, four copper layers (In1 = GND), top-side assembly.\nSee README.md and reports/ for checks and remaining release gates.\nJST battery polarity must be checked against the physical harness.\nRF, load/supply ramp, noise and 3D enclosure checks remain hardware / mechanical work." (at 25 158 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left)) (uuid "e30542b2-44fb-5c1e-b4ec-9f5bb95a7883"))
